          "startingLine": 216
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Open Wattspur to import them.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 49,
          "startingLine": 217
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "In komoot, open the tour you have ridden, export it as a GPX file and share that file to Wattspur. A planned tour has no times and is not a ride.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 219
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "In Strava on the web, open the activity and export it as GPX, then share the file to Wattspur.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 221
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "In Garmin Connect, open the activity and export it as GPX or as the original FIT file, then share the file to Wattspur.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 223
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Wattspur does not load links. Export the ride as a FIT or GPX file in that app and share the file to Wattspur.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 225
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Wattspur reads rides as FIT or GPX files. Share the file of a ride, not a picture or a text.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 31,
          "startingLine": 227
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Done",
        "location": {
